   "row": {
    "statement": "For all UK authorised products, where an MAH concludes from its assessment that a signal detected through any other data source, not meeting the IX.C.4.1 or IX.C.4.2 conditions, requires further analysis by the licensing authority, it should complete the standalone signal notification form on the national web-portal and send it to the licensing authority by the designated mailbox.",
